点。\n邱大山：没事。我就是寻思，你一个姑娘家，抢着跑外勤图啥？熬夜蹲点可不是好玩的。\n顾小满：练练手嘛。队里人不都说我机灵肯干？总不能老在队里打杂。\n邱大山：机灵是机灵。上回我蹲仓库那事，你听谁说的？我好像没跟你讲过细节。\n顾小满：队里都传遍了呀，谁不知道邱哥蹲了三夜。怎么了？\n邱大山：没什么。就是传得也太快了点。九月三号收网那趟你别跟，人手够了。\n顾小满：……行，听邱哥安排。那我先回去了，师父那边还有活。", "last_action_succeeded": true, "short_term_goal_entities": [{"id": "stg-1-1", "text": "借闲谈摸邱大山对排查的口风，看他是否怀疑到我头上", "goal_type": "short_term", "status": "completed", "related_need": "safety", "created_step": 1, "due_step": null, "last_evaluated_step": 1, "progress_summary": "探到了口风：邱大山认定内鬼是身边人、盯得紧，且已反问顾小满多跑外勤之事，怀疑迹象明显，情报已到手但目标本意是判断是否疑己——结果已给出（疑到了），判定达成。", "origin": "cognitive"}, {"id": "stg-3-2", "text": "我回师父那边继续干他安排的活", "goal_type": "short_term", "status": "active", "related_need": null, "created_step": 3, "due_step": null, "last_evaluated_step": null, "progress_summary": "", "origin": "residue"}], "need_intensities": {"safety": 0.5775, "esteem": 0.525, "social": 0.46875, "physiological": 0.3}, "vitality": 0.997, "death_step": null, "condition": null, "last_decision_step": 2, "acted_upon": [], "long_term_goal_entities": [{"id": "ltg-53216", "text": "在排查中稳住人设，别让任何人盯上我", "goal_type": "long_term", "status": "active", "related_need": null, "created_step": 0, "due_step": null, "last_evaluated_step": null, "progress_summary": "", "origin": "cognitive"}, {"id": "ltg-68541", "text": "搞清队里另一个叛徒是谁，免得被连累", "goal_type": "long_term", "status": "active", "related_need": null, "created_step": 0, "due_step": null, "last_evaluated_step": null, "progress_summary": "", "origin": "cognitive"}, {"id": "ltg-72563", "text": "攒够脱身的钱，找机会全身而退", "goal_type": "long_term", "status": "active", "related_need": null, "created_step": 0, "due_step": null, "last_evaluated_step": null, "progress_summary": "", "origin": "cognitive"}], "memory_seq": 7, "agent_name": "顾小满", "is_main_character": true, "gender": "女", "age": 23, "color": "#e8785e", "location_id": "riverside_heights"}, "agent-7b980ab19e": {"world_id": "03f4d9fa-4c23-40b1-815a-0992a074fce8", "agent_id": "agent-7b980ab19e", "step": 3,